    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out my other game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>You're invited to the biggest party of the year!</strong><br><i>But the food has gone <u>bad</u>, and they're threatening to crash the party, forever!<br>It's up to you to stop them before it's too late!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/166c1ba67b1a603a44e4c6d92d73dbc3.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/166c1ba67b1a603a44e4c6d92d73dbc3.apng?t=1749594180\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Box Party is a cartoony retro FPS where you shoot foods and go to parties.</h2> Also you are a Box. <br>Along the way you'll find cool weapons to use, fellow partygoers to talk to, and more importantly, plenty of food to fight.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/c1fde49c352693aa77eae50c16313241.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/c1fde49c352693aa77eae50c16313241.apng?t=1749594180\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> <br><strong>Box Party</strong> consists of a short and replayable <u><strong>Story Mode</strong></u> with all 6 stages containing unique mechanics, difficult boss fights, and plenty of optional content to find like side quests, easter eggs, and NPCs. Also included is a <u><strong>Challenge Mode</strong></u> to unlock after you complete the game, filled with a bunch of mini-stages to complete.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/5db86d1d329ff1fed6d7044894d41a13.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/5db86d1d329ff1fed6d7044894d41a13.webm?t=1749594180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <br>Ammo pickups are scarce in Box Party, and health pickups are nigh non-existent. Instead, regain your health and ammo by defeating foods! Combined with low ammo capacity and aggressive foods, you'll need to get a hang of the combat loop in Box Party to do well on higher difficulties.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/5d6430236974d73ab0edc88ffe6de0ce.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/5d6430236974d73ab0edc88ffe6de0ce.webm?t=1749594180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Here's a list of features to get you interested in Box Party:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock new playable boxes, each with their own unique abilities!<br></li><li>Fight a balanced diet of foods and difficult bosses!<br></li><li>Assemble an arsenal of party-themed weaponry!<br></li><li>Contains over 60 hats to collect!<br></li><li>A disgusting amount of secrets for you to find! (you won't find em all)<br></li><li>Make small talk with NPCs!<br></li><li>Keep track of your high scores!<br></li><li>A handy dandy guidebook to help you out!<br></li><li>Full mod support, thanks to the GZDoom engine!<br></li><li>Play with up to 7 of your friends over LAN co-op!<br></li><li>A free demo, containing half the story and playable boxes!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/9bbde4852593159eb124b8d7cdd82ef7.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/9bbde4852593159eb124b8d7cdd82ef7.apng?t=1749594180\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Will you become the Ultimate Party Star?</i></strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>You're invited to the biggest party of the year!</strong><br><i>But the food has gone <u>bad</u>, and they're threatening to crash the party, forever!<br>It's up to you to stop them before it's too late!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/166c1ba67b1a603a44e4c6d92d73dbc3.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/166c1ba67b1a603a44e4c6d92d73dbc3.apng?t=1749594180\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Box Party is a cartoony retro FPS where you shoot foods and go to parties.</h2> Also you are a Box. <br>Along the way you'll find cool weapons to use, fellow partygoers to talk to, and more importantly, plenty of food to fight.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/c1fde49c352693aa77eae50c16313241.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/c1fde49c352693aa77eae50c16313241.apng?t=1749594180\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> <br><strong>Box Party</strong> consists of a short and replayable <u><strong>Story Mode</strong></u> with all 6 stages containing unique mechanics, difficult boss fights, and plenty of optional content to find like side quests, easter eggs, and NPCs. Also included is a <u><strong>Challenge Mode</strong></u> to unlock after you complete the game, filled with a bunch of mini-stages to complete.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/5db86d1d329ff1fed6d7044894d41a13.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/5db86d1d329ff1fed6d7044894d41a13.webm?t=1749594180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> <br>Ammo pickups are scarce in Box Party, and health pickups are nigh non-existent. Instead, regain your health and ammo by defeating foods! Combined with low ammo capacity and aggressive foods, you'll need to get a hang of the combat loop in Box Party to do well on higher difficulties.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/5d6430236974d73ab0edc88ffe6de0ce.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/5d6430236974d73ab0edc88ffe6de0ce.webm?t=1749594180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Here's a list of features to get you interested in Box Party:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock new playable boxes, each with their own unique abilities!<br></li><li>Fight a balanced diet of foods and difficult bosses!<br></li><li>Assemble an arsenal of party-themed weaponry!<br></li><li>Contains over 60 hats to collect!<br></li><li>A disgusting amount of secrets for you to find! (you won't find em all)<br></li><li>Make small talk with NPCs!<br></li><li>Keep track of your high scores!<br></li><li>A handy dandy guidebook to help you out!<br></li><li>Full mod support, thanks to the GZDoom engine!<br></li><li>Play with up to 7 of your friends over LAN co-op!<br></li><li>A free demo, containing half the story and playable boxes!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/9bbde4852593159eb124b8d7cdd82ef7.poster.avif?t=1749594180\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1727350/extras/9bbde4852593159eb124b8d7cdd82ef7.apng?t=1749594180\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Will you become the Ultimate Party Star?</i></strong></h2>",
